nomaly and announced improvements to its pricing model", "source": "Typefully", "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "likeCount": 10, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 1662, "createdAt": "Tue Aug 04 08:02:08 +0000 2026", "lang": "en", "bookmarkCount": 1, "isReply": true, "inReplyToId": "2084550429413896368", "conversationId": "2084550366511906919", "media": [], "inReplyToUserId": "1806351518313922561", "author": {"type": "user", "userName": "eyeonchains", "url": "https://x.com/eyeonchains", "id": "1806351518313922561", "name": "Eye", "isVerified": false, "isBlueVerified": true, "profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917655327794696192/3U9biTVu_normal.jpg", "coverPicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1806351518313922561/1746039650", "description": "On-chain sleuth \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f", "location": "onchain", "followers": 19383, "following": 717, "createdAt": "Thu Jun 27 15:39:17 +0000 2024", "canDm": true}, "quoted_tweet": null, "retweeted_tweet": null}, {"type": "tweet", "id": "2084550429413896368", "url": "https://x.com/eyeonchains/status/2084550429413896368", "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/eyeonchains/status/2084550429413896368", "text": "6/ According to source and traders involved, something even stranger happened.\n\nDuring the critical seconds of the liquidation cascade, new orders reportedly could not be submitted.\n\nIf accurate, only traders with existing positions or resting orders already in the book, could benefit from the move. This doesn't necessarily imply malicious intent, an oracle printing a bad price doesn't mean real orders existed anywhere near that level on the book.\n\nOne participant summarized the dynamic:\n\n\"Fake prices liquidated real positions\" while noting that real traders \"couldn't buy at fake prices\" either.\n\nAnother reported a funding-rate arbitrage position worth roughly $80M being liquidated/ADL'd during the event.", "source": "Typefully", "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "likeCount": 10, "quoteC